    "Markdown!skala_notes": {
      "fontSize": 12,
      "renderMode": "static",
      "markdown": "## Skala simulation\n\n**Drive:** RViz \u2192 Enable WASD; W/S forward/reverse, A/D turn, Space stops. Windows XInput: hold LB + left stick; B stops.\n\n**Record:** Start MCAP, drive, then Stop and save. Recordings stay in `/home/ros/bags/skala` in the persistent Docker home. Each capture is limited to five minutes.\n\n**Interpretation:** All telemetry here is simulated. Track parameters remain uncalibrated. Simulator truth is for evaluation; SLAM uses scan and odometry. IMU is displayed but not fused into SLAM.",
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Session notes"
    },
